        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu byonabyona ebya kyabazinga Solomoni bye yakozesanga ku by'okunhwa, byali bya zaabu. Era ebintu byonabyona ebyakozesebwanga ku by'okulya mu ndhu eyayetebwanga Ekibira kya Lebanoni, byali bya zaabu mukenenule. Tighaaligho kintu kyonakyona kya feeza, kuba mu biseera bya Solomoni, feeza tiyatwalibwanga ng'ekintu eky'omughendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yali n'olugololiro olw'amaato agaajanga e Tarushishi ku nhandha enene nga gali ghalala n'olugololiro olw'amaato ga Hiramu. Buli lumaliira lwa myaka esatu, olugololiro olw'amaato olwo lwairanga okuva e Tarushishi nga luleese zaabu, ni feeza, n'amasanka, n'ensude, n'enkembo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale atyo kyabazinga Solomoni yaasingira ghala bakyabazinga boonaboona ku nsi, obukombe n'amagezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'omu nsi yoonayoona baayendanga okwidha aghali Solomoni oyo, okuwulira ebibono eby'amagezi ge, Katonda ge yamugha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muntu eyaidhanga, ng'aleeta ekirabo: ebintu bya feeza n'ebya zaabu, ebivaalo, eby'okulwanisa, obuwoowo, embalaasi n'enhumbu. Abantu baaleetanga ebintu ebyo buli mwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni yasoloza ebigaali eby'omu lutalo n'abavuzi b'embalaasi. Yali n'ebigaali eby'omu lutalo lukumi na bina (1,400), n'abavuzi b'embalaasi omutwalo mulala n'enkumi ibiri (12,000) abandi yaabata mu bibuga ebikuumirwamu ebigaali eby'omu lutalo, ate abandi yaabata mu Yerusalemu, mwene ye yali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera bye, feeza yayala mu Yerusalemu, yaaba mungi ng'oti bwa mabaale. N'emivule gyaba mingi ng'oti miti emisikamore egy'omu biketezo eby'omu biiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embalaasi Solomoni dhe yali nadho, yadhiragirizanga kuva mu Misiri ni mu Kue, era abasuubuzi be baadhisasuliranga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigaali eky'omu lutalo ekirala kyagulwanga mu Misiri ku bitundu lukaaga ebya feeza, n'embalaasi endala yaagulwanga ku bitundu kikumi n'ataanu ebya feeza. Bakyabazinga boonaboona ab'Abahitti n'ab'e Siria, baagulanga ebigaali eby'omu lutalo n'embalaasi, ku basuubuzi ba Solomoni abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
